# Hi, I'm Gustavo Marinho

I'm a **Systems Analysis and Development** student at **UNINTER**, focused on building my career as a **Junior Java Backend Developer**.

I develop portfolio projects centered on **Java, Spring Boot, REST APIs, relational databases, Docker and Git**, with emphasis on authentication, validation, persistence, database migrations, API design and application deployment.

## Main stack

* Java 21
* Spring Boot
* REST APIs
* PostgreSQL
* Spring Data JPA / Hibernate
* Flyway
* JWT / Spring Security
* Docker and Docker Compose
* Git and GitHub
* React and TypeScript

## Featured projects

### Prioriza

A full-stack activity management application built to practice and demonstrate core backend development skills with Java and Spring Boot.

The project includes a Spring Boot back-end, a React/TypeScript front-end, authentication, protected routes, CRUD operations, pagination, filters, database persistence, migrations and deployment.

**Backend**

* Java 21
* Spring Boot
* PostgreSQL
* Spring Data JPA / Hibernate
* Flyway
* JWT / Spring Security
* Docker Compose

**Frontend**

* React
* TypeScript
* Vite
* Tailwind CSS

**What the project includes**

* Activity CRUD
* Data validation
* Pagination and filters
* JWT authentication
* Protected routes
* Relational database integration
* Database versioning with Flyway migrations
* Docker-based local environment
* Back-end and front-end deployment

**Links**

* Frontend: https://gustavomprado.github.io/prioriza-frontend/
* Backend production: https://task-manager-api-njza.onrender.com
* Health check: https://task-manager-api-njza.onrender.com/actuator/health
* Backend repository: https://github.com/GustavoMPrado/prioriza-api
* Frontend repository: https://github.com/GustavoMPrado/prioriza-frontend

> Note: the backend is hosted on Render free tier, so the first request may take a little longer because of cold start.

---

### Recebivel API

A back-end REST API in development for managing customers, charges, installments, due dates and payments for small businesses.

The project is focused on practicing business rules, domain organization, persistence, validation, status control and API structure using Java and Spring Boot.

**Backend**

* Java 21
* Spring Boot
* Maven
* PostgreSQL
* Spring Data JPA / Hibernate
* Flyway
* Docker

**What the project includes**

* Customer management
* Charge management
* Installment management
* Due date and payment control
* Status control
* Business rules
* Data validation
* Error handling
* Domain-based organization

